Today is Friday evening.
Suresh calls us all together.
We sit in a room.
Suresh asks, "What work have we done this week?"
Rohan says, "I have completed my coding."
Priya says, "As a designer, I have completed my work."
Vikram says, "I am a tester."
He further says, "I have tested the new code."
Then it is my turn.
I say, "I have fixed all the bugs."
Suresh is very satisfied.
He says, "You all have done excellent work."
We have all built a solid foundation.
The meeting ends and I go to my desk.
I pack my bag.
I feel that I am now a true and valued colleague.
I say goodbye to everyone and step out of the office.
My weekend has now started.
